{"parse": {"title": "世界上最小的涟漪-06", "pageid": 147256, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-05\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">世界上最小的涟漪-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-07\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">世界上最小的涟漪</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.B1.BC.E7.9A.84.E9.80.83.E4.BA.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"鱼的逃亡\">鱼的逃亡</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 鱼的逃亡</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">On Foreign Shores</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan3\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653219.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-653219.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653219.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653219.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-653219.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653219.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-653219.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653219.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>纳西索斯，我还是有点担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653218.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-653218.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653218.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653218.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-653218.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653218.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/HeadIconSmall-653218.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653218.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>你确定你见到的真的是塔拉萨本人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信使满心疑惑地握着从宁芙朋友那里获得的赠票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>她不会是假扮的吧？不是我不相信，是深海鱼人太可疑了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>阿波罗，你见过真正的深海鱼人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他抬起手肘碰了碰站在身边的预言者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>我听过一些传说，鱼人和宁芙一样具有许多分支。史前的深海之中也爆发过鱼人之间的战争……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>他们有的被永远困在了深海之中，有的经历分化，分散至浅海甚至陆地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>——但这些也只是尚未得到证实的传闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁，他们的宁芙朋友并未在意他们的谈话，只是全神贯注地看着幕布还未拉开的舞台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>嘘、嘘！安静！演出马上就要开始了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan3\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众I：</div><div>太棒了！太精彩了！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>泉水宁芙和深海鱼人的友情……啊！多么感人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众III：</div><div>上帝啊！赞美塔拉萨！赞美您留下来的……无与伦比的故事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>怎么样？塔拉萨的故事很棒吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>的确名副其实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>认真看完整场表演的裁判严谨地评价道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-653101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿波罗：</div><div>可谓是惊心动魄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/06/HeadIconSmall-653202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>我已经完全成为了塔拉萨的粉丝！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>哼哼，还没结束呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙神色雀跃，像兜售着难得一见的精彩故事的人，示意朋友们继续关注舞台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众I：</div><div>咦？演出还没结束吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>说不定是欢庆日的特别演出呢！哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>能抢到票真是太幸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>……啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇人欣喜的感慨突兀地停住了，她睁大了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众III：</div><div>那是什么？我的老天啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>欢迎……各位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许是舞台灯光太过明亮，或许是观众的噤声太过突兀，这让她在目光的海洋之中显得有些孤立无援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她还是向前了一步，使自己的面貌经受那些视线的洗礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>有时候，在戏剧谢幕时，剧作者也会在结尾登场，与演员们一同谢幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>这是……我一直想做的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>经过了漫长的等待，直到今天，我才真正站到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眨了眨圆溜溜的眼睛，一条深海鱼人在人类的舞台上深深地吸了口气。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan4\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>请容我做一次自我介绍吧，我是——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_juyuan3\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_juyuan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_juyuan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众I：</div><div>不——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众I：</div><div>怪物！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>请您……求您不要说出塔拉萨的名字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>……这太荒谬了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有人惊愕，有人恼怒，有人痛哭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们反对塔拉萨是一个存在于现实中的深海鱼人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>塔拉萨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下一秒，一个小小的身影蹿上了台，顺便打飞了一只从观众席扔向鱼人的手套。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她张开双臂，护在了塔拉萨——她的同盟身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>她说她叫塔拉萨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>她就是塔拉萨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不要捂上你们的眼睛和耳朵，好好承认这个事实吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙怒气冲冲，纤细的耳鳍一根一根竖了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>为什么你们这么爱她的故事和作品，却无法接受她本来的样子呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你们口口声声说着爱塔拉萨的灵魂，可等到真正的塔拉萨站到你们的面前，她却连自己的名字都无法拥有了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这个世界有那么……那么大！多得是我们从来没有见过的人和事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>有时候，你们还会发现你们连最熟悉的人都不了解！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她喘着气，脸涨得愈发红了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>可是那又怎么样呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>总是待在浅水里，看着一成不变的世界，做着一成不变的选择，又怎么能理解大海的多变和广阔？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>你们应该向塔拉萨道歉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一片静默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>至少，没有人再否定塔拉萨的名字了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>好、好吧……只要你们发誓不再伤害塔拉萨……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的气势弱下来，磕磕巴巴地说道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>纳西索斯！快下来！警察来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安静的人群此刻开始解冻，声音重新激昂起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-305820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众III：</div><div>滚下去——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>咦？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙矮下身子，懦弱而灵活地躲避飞来的水瓶与纸团，随即反身紧紧抓住了塔拉萨的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>塔拉萨！跟我跑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像闯了大祸一般，两人一齐跳进了后台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而观众席上愤怒的反对仍在继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众I：</div><div>她们肯定是一伙的——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众I：</div><div>诈骗犯！合谋冒充塔拉萨，要借此敛财！她们玷污了塔拉萨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与此同时，也有一些疑惑的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>塔拉萨是一个鱼人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304130.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304130.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-304130.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304130.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众II：</div><div>这是真的吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_5_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_5_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_5_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-3_5_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_5_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-3_5_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_5_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/Cg-3_5_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_5_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>塔拉萨，你没事吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扭头关切地看着鱼人，事态的发展远超想象，使她心跳如擂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>我没事，谢谢你，纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>大家的反应……在我的预料之内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>那你为什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙瞪大了眼睛，满心不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察I：</div><div>她们躲在这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>还未得到答案，纳西索斯连连喘着气，但还是要继续跑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>塔拉萨！我们走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-514420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察II：</div><div>别让她们跑了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本不属于陆地的双脚结结实实地踏在地上。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_32\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/Cg-3_9_at_32.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/Cg-3_9_at_32.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/Cg-3_9_at_32.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊……呼……呼……要跑不动了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>让宁芙在陆地上跑步简直是酷刑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她满头大汗，心跳得越来越快，双腿发软，仿佛下一秒就要扑倒在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她仍一步一步地迈出去，狼狈地在遥远的异乡街头奔跑着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>呼……呼……鱼人……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_30.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_30\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_30\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-3_9_at_30.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_30.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-3_9_at_30.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_30.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-3_9_at_30.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_30.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"655603.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"655603.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-655603.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-655603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塔拉萨：</div><div>鱼人也是……哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>哈哈哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两条“鱼”对视着，在逃亡途中不合时宜地笑了出来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_32\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/Cg-3_9_at_32.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/Cg-3_9_at_32.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/Cg-3_9_at_32.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊！荷米斯！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shezhengjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shezhengjie\"><img alt=\"shezhengjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/600px-Cg-shezhengjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/900px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-shezhengjie.png/1200px-Cg-shezhengjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火山岛的朋友们也如同曙光一般降临了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-653213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">荷米斯：</div><div>纳西索斯，塔拉萨，快上车！</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "世界上最小的涟漪-06"}}